title: speeds on most highways? 2-lane undivided ones? with a trailer?
pid: 3fb67d89-00a4-4547-8f35-7eba2e121e77
body: |2-
  Unless otherwise posted, the ideal maximum speed limit on
  - most California highways : 65 mph
  - a two-lane undivided highway : 55 mph
  - for vehicles towing trailers : 55 mph
